  Warning  Failed       2m40s                  kubelet            spec.containers{speaker}: Failed to pull image "quay.io/metallb/speaker:v0.16.1": failed to pull and unpack image "quay.io/metallb/speaker:v0.16.1": short read: expected 38234495 bytes but got 7463108: unexpected EOF
